{"ref":"powerup:reroll","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":120,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Reroll is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects the amount of times the player can reroll the rewards when leveling up or selecting an Arcana."]},{"k":"p","c":["The items that were discarded by a reroll cannot appear in the new set of items. However, this does not completely remove them from the pool, and they can be offered again in the same level up if more rerolls are used. Arcanas that are rerolled, on the other hand, are removed from the pool and do not appear again in the same chest."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how many Rerolls the player may have."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["13 February 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["REROLL"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Reroll PowerUp increases Reroll by 2 per rank, with a maximum rank of 5 after unlocking all Reroll achievements. With one rank unlocked it initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Reroll"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+4"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+6"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+8"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+10"]}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Each rank of PowerUp is unlocked by these achievements:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Reaching level 80 with ",{"i":"Sprite-Mortaccio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mortaccio"}," ",{"t":"Mortaccio","r":"character:mortaccio"}]},{"c":["Reaching level 80 with ",{"i":"Sprite-Yatta_Cavallo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:y